# Dot-directories at the root hold local tool, editor and notes state; only CI config is tracked
/.*/
!/.github/
.env*
!.env.example
node_modules
.next
.vercel
next-env.d.ts
*.tsbuildinfo
SHIP-STATE.md
BRIEF.md
design*.md
plan*.md
ui-prototypes/
variants/
mockups/
*-internal/
AGENTS.md

# General Sans is fetched at build time (Fontshare licence: self-host, do not redistribute)
public/fonts/*.woff2
